      "name": "Mariselvi R",
      "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:42:26.068Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I want to allow users to create linked documents from the Connections section even when the parent document is in Draft (docstatus = 0).</p>\n<p>For example, in Sales Invoice, I want the “+” button to appear for Payment Entry even when the invoice is not submitted.</p>\n<p>By default, Frappe only shows the + button for submitted documents. But in my use case, users must be able to create linked documents while the parent is still in draft.</p>\n<p><strong>My requirement:</strong> “Show + Create button in Connections even when parent document is in Draft.”</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5_2_690x321.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"g9FCM3Ddts1wT1W0gb9oOxpXYNf\" width=\"690\" height=\"321\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5_2_690x321.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5_2_1035x481.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/713aa818bc85de9cc12671b946109c10a1c5bcf5_2_1380x642.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1D21\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1539×717 58.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>After Submit the doctype</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/a/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/a/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27_2_690x321.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8o8xxwnmF1uBzYXFEFGwFDVVpUb\" width=\"690\" height=\"321\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/a/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27_2_690x321.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/a/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27_2_1035x481.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/a/3acbe5ad90c0eaae1a0ca58be7466c2bf458bb27_2_1380x642.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1B1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1539×717 57.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
